{%- render 'glp1-assets' -%}
<div class="g1">
  <section class="g1-sec">
    <div class="g1-wrap">
      <div class="g1-center">
        <div class="g1-eyebrow">What to expect</div>
        <h2 class="g1-h2">Hair runs on a 3-month clock.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="g1-tl">
        <div><div class="g1-when">Weeks 1 to 8</div><h3>The old shed finishes</h3><p>Hairs that went to rest before day 1 are already on their way out. They still fall. The fair test is what stops joining them.</p></div>
        <div><div class="g1-when">Month 3</div><h3>The growth phase holds</h3><p>This is where the trial counted, and growth-phase hairs were up 52%. Short new hairs start to show along the part.</p></div>
        <div><div class="g1-when">Months 4 to 6</div><h3>The danger window passes</h3><p>When an untreated shed usually peaks. At 6 months, 0% of the spermidine group had hair come loose on a tug. On placebo: 68%.</p></div>
        <div><div class="g1-when">Months 6 to 18</div><h3>The ponytail comes back</h3><p>Full thickness takes 12 to 18 months, because new hair has to grow out to length. Every month in the growth phase is more length kept.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="g1-center" style="margin-top:40px"><a href="#offer" class="g1-btn g1-inline">Start The 3-Month Clock</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

